SLICK TOP V1.0

Why ???

coz i wanted a confrence and total top u/l list for my board so i wrote one!
and after many weeks of beta testing on my board all my users say its the best!

this door can be a seprate confrece top up or a total overall top u/l list or
a mixture of 2 confs! READ ON!

usage:

its best for a board that has confrerence accounting turned ON to have a
seprate top u/l list for each conf that way it makes it a lot fairer on users
imagine you have a pc conf and an amiga conf the top u/l list could be pc
users only as the pc files are genrallty bigger so you ve a top u/l list when
entering each confrence that support warez!. 

INSTALLATION:

slicktop is run from your bbs loggoff script. 

SYNTAX is:

outputfile datafile (link datafile2) max style confrencename (append)

EXAMPLE:

slicktop bbs:bull50.txt.gr bbs:amiga/conf.db 20 1 "Amiga Warez"
		  ^  		  ^	      ^ ^        ^	 	
		  |		  |	      | |        |_ confrencename						
		  |		  |	      |	|_outputstyle
		  |		  |	      |_maxusers
 		  |		  |_datafile
                  |_outputfile

outputfile: textfile to be created

datafile:   	path to a conf.db/user.data file
	    	if you enter a conf.db file then the top u/l list will be for
	    	that confrence only. 
	    	If you enter user.data file then the top u/l will be a over all
		top u/l list for all confs.

maxusers:   	any number from 1-40 this will specify how many users to be 
	    	shown in the list.

outputstyle:    any number from 0-13 this specifys the look of the bull to 
		be created please look at the output files in this arc.

confrencename:  the name of the confrence you are making the top u/l list for
		If confrece name is 2 words or more enter name inside " "
		if you specify a user.data file for datafile then confrencename
		will automaticly be changed to overall top uploaders.

append		Will append 1 output to another so you can create a 
		console list for snes and megadrive if you have seprate
		confs for console warez 

LINK		join 2 confs together! see below


EXAMPLE: of the append command

slicktop bbs:snes/bull50.txt.gr bbs:SNES/conf.db 10 1 "Snes Warez"
slicktop bbs:snes/bull50.txt.gr bbs:SEGA/conf.db 10 1 "Sega Warez" append


******LINK MODE!!!!******** (NEW)

Although append mode is cool it only really adds a list to another list
LINK mode is a combination of 2 confs combined.
LINK mode will take 2 confrences that you specify take the stats from 1
conf add them to the stats of another conf and add them then sort them.
this means if you have a Snes conf and a Sega conf you can take both conf
stats add them and make 1 upload list
IE.

USER BUGBYTE has 100000 Bytes uploded in Snes and 200000 in Sega
LINK mode will take the 100000 and 200000 and make 300000
and use this as the users byte uploads! and sort accordingly.
Format is:

outputfile datafile1 LINK datafile2 max style confrencename

EXAMPLE:
slicktop bbs:bull1 snes:conf.db LINK Sega:conf.db 10 1 "Sega & Snes"


thanx goto LAVIATHON for this cooooooool idea! cheers m8! 
	


SOME EXAMPLES

-----------------Create a Overall All Confrences Top u/l --------------------

slicktop bbs:screens/bull50.txt.gr bbs:user.data 20 1 "Overall top uploaders."

------------------Create Amiga Confrece Top U/l list-------------------------

slicktop bbs:amiga/bull50.txt.gr bbs:amiga/conf.db 20 2 "Amiga Warez"

------------Create a list for snes & sega and append the output--------------

slicktop bbs:snes/bull50.txt.gr bbs:SNES/conf.db 10 3 "Snes Warez"
slicktop bbs:snes/bull50.txt.gr bbs:SEGA/conf.db 10 3 "Sega Warez" append

------------Create Combined Linked u/l for Sega and snes---------------------

slicktop bbs:bull1 snes:conf.db LINK Sega:conf.db 10 6 "Sega & Snes"

